silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'BridgeToYonedaLemmaConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the incoming-arrow profile of the governed Mittens individual: type probes (to Cat), quality probes (body mass 4.3 kg), process probes (vet exam participation), role probes (clinic patient at Tartu clinic), taxonomy probes (Felis catus/TSN 183798), evidence probes (vet record), validation probes — the full rich profile that distinguishes Mittens from any storage row; also, the Yoneda embedding from the Granite category to the presheaf category: maps each object (Mittens, GraniteRow, VetCarePlan_77, etc.) to its represented presheaf Hom(-,X)." .
